[ ` WeakMap.prototype.delete() ` ](/en-
US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap/delete)



Removes any value associated to the ` key ` . ` WeakMap.prototype.has(key) `
will return ` false ` afterwards.

[ ` WeakMap.prototype.get() ` ](/en-
US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap/get)



Returns the value associated to the ` key ` , or ` undefined ` if there is
none.

[ ` WeakMap.prototype.has() ` ](/en-
US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap/has)



Returns a Boolean asserting whether a value has been associated to the ` key `
in the ` WeakMap ` object or not.

[ ` WeakMap.prototype.set() ` ](/en-
US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap/set)



Sets the ` value ` for the ` key ` in the ` WeakMap ` object. Returns the `
